#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:4
#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:204
msgid "Using the Version Control System"
msgstr "使用版本控制系统"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:5
msgid ""
"The version control system keeps in a central repository a constant history of "
"revisions for every file in the production database."
msgstr "版本控制系统在中央存储库中保存生产数据库中每个文件的不断修订历史。"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:7
msgid ""
"The **central repository** must be located in a shared resource (that can be a "
"computer in your local network or an internet-based repository), while the "
"local copy of files, called **working copy**, at a specific time or revision, "
"should be located on the computer you use."
msgstr ""
"**中央存储库**必须位于共享资源中（可以是本地网络中的计算机或基于互联网的存储"
"库），而文件的本地副本，即特定时间或版本的**工作副本**，应位于您使用的计算机上。"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:9
msgid ""
"When you need to work on a file, you can *get* it from the central repository "
"to your working copy, and *edit* it; when you finish working on the file and "
"you want to submit the changes, you can *put* it back from your working copy to "
"the central repository."
msgstr ""
"当你需要处理一个文件时，你可以从中央存储库*获取*到*你的工作副本，并*编辑*它；当"
"您完成对文件的处理并希望提交更改时，您可以将其从工作副本放回中央存储库。"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:11
msgid ""
"The file you *put* will be saved as the last revision of the file, while the "
"previous revisions will be retained as file history, and all the users sharing "
"the same central repository can *get* if from there. In case a previous version "
"of the file is needed, it is always possible to retrieve it from the central "
"repository."
msgstr ""
"您*放置*的文件将保存为文件的最后一个版本，而之前的版本将保留为文件历史记录，共享"
"同一中央存储库的所有用户都可以从那里*获取*。如果需要文件的先前版本，始终可以从中"
"央存储库中检索它。"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:13
msgid ""
"OpenToonz supports the **Subversion** version control system, which is one of "
"the most popular version control systems, used in many high-scale open source "
"projects."
msgstr ""
"OpenToonz支持**Subversion**版本控制系统，这是最流行的版本控制系统之一，用于许多"
"大规模的开源项目。"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:15
msgid ""
"The *central repository* defined for your version control system behaves "
"exactly as an OpenToonz projectroot, therefore the project management under the "
"version control system is the same, only referencing to the central repository "
"instead of the projectroot (see  :ref:`Managing Projects "
"<managing_projects>`  )."
msgstr ""
"为您的版本控制系统定义的*中央存储库*的行为与OpenToonz项目根完全相同，因此版本控"
"制系统下的项目管理是相同的，只引用中央存储库而不是项目根（请参阅：ref:“管理项目"
"<manageing_Projects>”）。"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:21
msgid "Installing the Version Control System"
msgstr "安装版本控制系统"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:22
msgid ""
"The version control system works as a client/server tool: the server stores all "
"of your files in a central repository, and a client is used to *get* files to "
"your working copy and *put* file changes to the server."
msgstr ""
"版本控制系统作为客户端/服务器工具工作：服务器将您的所有文件存储在中央存储库中，"
"客户端用于将*文件获取到您的工作副本，并将*文件更改放入服务器。"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:25
msgid "Installing the Version Control Server"
msgstr "安装版本控制系统"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:27
msgid ""
"It's possible to configure a computer in your local network as the version "
"control server by installing **Subversion 1.6** or later, or it's possible to "
"use an on-line service (e.g. Assembla)."
msgstr ""
"通过安装**Subversion 1.6**或更高版本，可以将本地网络中的计算机配置为版本控制服务"
"器，也可以使用在线服务（例如Assembla）。"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:29
msgid ""
"You can go to the `Subversion starting page <http://subversion.apache.org/>`_ "
"for downloading it."
msgstr "您可以转到“Subversion起始页”<http://subversion.apache.org/>`_下载它。"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:31
msgid "Contact your system administrator to configure a version control server."
msgstr "请与系统管理员联系以配置版本控制服务器。"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:37
msgid "Installing the Version Control Client on Windows"
msgstr "在Windows上安装版本控制客户端"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:38
msgid ""
"On Windows the setup of a version control client requires the download and "
"installation of the **Subversion client 1.6** or later."
msgstr ""
"在Windows上，安装版本控制客户端需要下载并安装**Subversion客户端1.6**或更高版本。"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:40
msgid ""
"You can go to the `Subversion download page <http://subversion.apache.org/"
"packages.html#windows>`_ for downloading it. There you should look for the "
"available binary packages and download a version control client for Windows. We "
"suggest the use of **CollabNet Subversion Command-Line Client**."
msgstr ""
"你可以去“Subversion下载页面<http://subversion.apache.org/packages."
"html#windows>`_您应该在那里查找可用的二进制包，并下载适用于Windows的版本控制客户"
"端。我们建议使用**CollabNet Subversion命令行客户端**。"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:42
msgid ""
"If an older Subversion release is used some version control features might not "
"work."
msgstr "如果使用较旧的Subversion版本，某些版本控制功能可能无法工作。"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:48
msgid "Installing the Version Control Client on Macintosh"
msgstr "在Macintosh上安装版本控制客户端"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:49
msgid ""
"On Macintosh the setup of a version control client depends on the OS version."
msgstr "在Macintosh上，版本控制客户端的设置取决于操作系统版本。"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:51
msgid ""
"If the OS is Snow Leopard (version 10.6) or later, the setup requires no "
"installation as the version control client is included in the operating system."
msgstr ""
"如果操作系统是Snow Leopard（10.6版）或更高版本，则安装程序不需要安装，因为版本控"
"制客户端包含在操作系统中。"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:53
msgid ""
"If the OS is *older* than Snow Leopard, the setup requires the download and "
"installation of the **Subversion client 1.6** or later."
msgstr ""
"如果操作系统比Snow Leopard*旧*，则安装程序需要下载并安装**Subversion客户端1.6**"
"或更高版本。"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:55
msgid ""
"You can go to the `Subversion download page <http://subversion.apache.org/"
"packages.html#osx>`_ for downloading it. There you should look for the "
"available binary packages and download a version control client for Macintosh."
msgstr ""
"你可以去“Subversion下载页面<http://subversion.apache.org/packages.html#osx>`_您"
"应该在那里查找可用的二进制包，并下载Macintosh的版本控制客户端。"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:57
msgid ""
"After the installation is very important to check where Subversion is "
"installed, as this information is needed to configure the version control in "
"OpenToonz: this information is displayed in the last page of the installation "
"process and by default is usually ``/opt/subversion/bin`` ."
msgstr ""
"安装后检查Subversion的安装位置非常重要，因为在OpenToonz中配置版本控制需要此信"
"息：此信息显示在安装过程的最后一页，默认情况下通常为“/opt/Subversion/bin”。"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:59
msgid ""
"If a Subversion release older than v1.6 is used, some version control features "
"might not work."
msgstr "如果使用早于v1.6的Subversion版本，则某些版本控制功能可能无法工作。"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:65
msgid "Configuring the Version Control in OpenToonz"
msgstr "在OpenToonz中配置版本控制"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:66
msgid ""
"Once the version control server is configured and the version control client is "
"installed it's possible to configure OpenToonz in order to use the version "
"control."
msgstr ""
"一旦配置了版本控制服务器并安装了版本控制客户端，就可以配置OpenToonz以使用版本控"
"制。"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:68
msgid ""
"In OpenToonz the version control information is stored in the ``versioncontrol."
"xml``  file located in the ``OpenToonz stuff\\config`` folder. By default the "
"file has the following content:"
msgstr ""
"在OpenToonz中，版本控制信息存储在位于“OpenToonz stuff\\config”文件夹中"
"的“versioncontrol.xml”文件中。默认情况下，文件包含以下内容："

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:85
msgid ""
"By editing the file with a text editor it's possible to set the information for "
"the *central repository* and the *working copy* location."
msgstr "通过使用文本编辑器编辑文件，可以设置*中央存储库*和*工作副本*位置的信息。"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:87
msgid ""
"Together with the configuration file, version control *users* must be defined "
"by editing the ``permissions.xml``  file located in the ``OpenToonz stuff"
"\\config`` folder."
msgstr ""
"与配置文件一起，版本控制*用户*必须通过编辑位于“OpenToonz stuff\\config”文件夹中"
"的“permissions.xml”文件来定义。"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:89
msgid ""
"The ``versioncontrol.xml``  and ``permissions.xml``  file have to be well-"
"formed, and so cannot contain an opening tag without its related closing tag, "
"otherwise OpenToonz will not run. If you decide to edit the files, make a "
"backup copy first in case you need to revert the file to the original version."
msgstr ""
"“versioncontrol.xml”和“permissions.xml”文件必须格式良好，因此不能包含没有相关结"
"束标记的开始标记，否则OpenToonz将无法运行。如果您决定编辑文件，请先制作一个备份"
"副本，以防需要将文件还原为原始版本。"

