#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:185
msgid "Initializing the Version Control in OpenToonz"
msgstr "在OpenToonz中初始化版本控制"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:186
msgid ""
"Before starting to use the version control system, it has to be initialized by "
"setting an option in the **Preferences** dialog and restarting OpenToonz."
msgstr ""
"在开始使用版本控制系统之前，必须通过在**首选项**对话框中设置一个选项并重新启动"
"OpenToonz来初始化它。"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:188
msgid ""
"At this point the repository will be displayed in the OpenToonz browser, and "
"you will be able to start using it."
msgstr "此时，存储库将显示在OpenToonz浏览器中，您将能够开始使用它。"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:190
msgid "**To initialize the version control system:**"
msgstr "**要初始化版本控制系统：**"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:192
msgid ""
"In OpenToonz open the Preferences...  →  Version Control dialog section and "
"activate the **Enable Version Control** option."
msgstr ""
"在OpenToonz中打开“首选项”。..  →  版本控制对话框部分，并激活**启用版本控制**选"
"项。"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:194
msgid ""
"If the version control is not correctly installed or the configuration file is "
"not correctly defined, activating the option will prompt a warning message."
msgstr "如果版本控制安装不正确或配置文件定义不正确，激活该选项将提示警告消息。"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:196
msgid "Quit and restart OpenToonz."
msgstr "退出并重新启动OpenToonz。"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:198
msgid ""
"In the OpenToonz browser look for the repository at the end of the folder tree, "
"named as you defined it in the configuration file; right-click it and choose "
"**Get** from the menu that opens to establish the connection between the "
"*central repository* and the local *working copy*."
msgstr ""
"在OpenToonz浏览器中，在文件夹树的末尾查找存储库，其名称与您在配置文件中定义的名"
"称相同；右键单击它，然后从打开的菜单中选择**获取**，以建立*中央存储库*和本地*工"
"作副本*之间的连接。"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:205
msgid ""
"The *central repository* and the local *working copy* are displayed in the "
"OpenToonz browser at the end of the folder tree as one single folder. By "
"navigating the contents of this folder it's possible to retrieve the folders "
"and files."
msgstr ""
"*中央存储库*和本地*工作副本*在OpenToonz浏览器的文件夹树末尾显示为一个文件夹。通"
"过浏览此文件夹的内容，可以检索文件夹和文件。"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:209
msgid ""
"One online repository defined (**svn_test**) hosting the active project "
"(**mySVNproject**)."
msgstr ""
"定义了一个在线存储库（**svn_test**），用于托管活动项目（**mySVNproject**）。"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:211
msgid ""
"When a folder is selected in the folder tree *a refresh operation occurs "
"automatically*, to check the status of the folder and its content. As this "
"operations may require some time according to the connection speed on the local "
"network or in the Internet, the automatic refresh operation can be disabled."
msgstr ""
"当在文件夹树中选择一个文件夹时，会自动执行刷新操作，以检查文件夹及其内容的状态。"
"由于根据本地网络或互联网上的连接速度，此操作可能需要一些时间，因此可以禁用自动刷"
"新操作。"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:213
msgid ""
"If several repositories are defined, each of them will be displayed with the "
"name previously assigned."
msgstr "如果定义了多个存储库，则每个存储库都将显示之前分配的名称。"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:215
msgid "**To disable the automatic refresh for folder content:**"
msgstr "**要禁用文件夹内容的自动刷新，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:217
msgid "Choose File  →  Preferences...  →  Version Control."
msgstr "选择文件→  偏好。..  →  版本控制。"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:219
msgid "Deactivate the **Automatically Refresh Folder Contents** option."
msgstr "停用**自动刷新文件夹内容**选项。"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:221
msgid "**To manually refresh a folder content visualization:**"
msgstr "**要手动刷新文件夹内容可视化，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:223
msgid ""
"Right-click the folder icon in the folder tree and choose **Refresh** from the "
"menu that opens."
msgstr "右键单击文件夹树中的文件夹图标，然后从打开的菜单中选择**刷新**。"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:229
msgid "Getting and Putting Folders and Files"
msgstr ""
"右键单击文件夹树中的文件夹图标，然后从打开的菜单中选择**刷新**。获取和放置文件夹"
"和文件"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:230
msgid ""
"The basic operations in the version control system involves *getting* files "
"from the central repository to the local working copy; and then *putting* the "
"modified files back from the local *working copy* to the *central repository*."
msgstr ""
"版本控制系统中的基本操作包括从中央存储库*获取*文件到本地工作副本；然后将修改后的"
"文件从本地工作副本放回中央存储库。"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:232
msgid "|put|"
msgstr "|put|"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:234
msgid ""
"In case you are *putting* folders, in the dialog that opens you can check which "
"files and folders contained in the selected folder have to be put in the "
"central repository. Every time files and folders are put, it is also possible "
"to type a *comment* to let the other users know about s of the performed "
"modifications."
msgstr ""
"如果您正在放置文件夹，在打开的对话框中，您可以检查所选文件夹中包含的哪些文件和文"
"件夹必须放置在中央存储库中。每次放置文件和文件夹时，也可以键入*注释*，让其他用户"
"知道所执行的修改。"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:236
msgid "|put_scene|"
msgstr "|put_scene|"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:238
msgid ""
"In case you are *getting* or *putting* scene files (TNZ format), in the dialog "
"that opens it's possible to check the **Get Scene Contents** or the **Put Scene "
"Contents** option to include with the request, or return back, the materials "
"used in the scene as well."
msgstr ""
"如果您正在*获取*或*放置*场景文件（TNZ格式），在打开的对话框中，可以选中**获取场"
"景内容**或**放置场景内容**选项，将其包含在请求中，或返回场景中使用的材质。"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:240
msgid ""
"The first time you *get* a folder not previously available in the *working "
"copy* (folder with grey icon), you get the files contained in the folder, but "
"not the sub-folders. The next time you *get* the folder (folder with a colored "
"icon), you get the entire contents of the folder, including sub-folders and the "
"related contents."
msgstr ""
"第一次*获得*工作副本*中以前不可用的文件夹（灰色图标的文件夹）时，您将获得该文件"
"夹中包含的文件，但不会获得子文件夹。下次您*获取*文件夹（带有彩色图标的文件夹）"
"时，您将获得文件夹的全部内容，包括子文件夹和相关内容。"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:242
msgid ""
"**To get the latest version of a folder or a file from the central repository "
"to the local working copy:**"
msgstr ""
"**要将文件夹或文件的最新版本从中央存储库获取到本地工作副本，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:244
msgid ""
"Right-click the folder icon in the folder tree, or the file icon in the "
"browser, and choose **Get** from the menu that opens."
msgstr ""
"右键单击文件夹树中的文件夹图标或浏览器中的文件图标，然后从打开的菜单中选择**获取"
"**。"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:246
msgid ""
"In the dialog that opens if you are getting a scene file (TNZ format) activate "
"the **Get Scene Contents** if you want to get the files used in the scene as "
"well."
msgstr ""
"如果要获取场景文件（TNZ格式），请在打开的对话框中激活**获取场景内容**，如果要同"
"时获取场景中使用的文件。"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:248
#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:366
msgid "Click the **Update** button."
msgstr "单击**更新**按钮。"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:250
msgid ""
"**To put your modified version of a folder or a file from the local working "
"copy to the central repository:**"
msgstr ""
"**要将文件夹或文件的修改版本从本地工作副本放入中央存储库，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:252
msgid ""
"Right-click the folder icon in the folder tree, or the file icon in the "
"browser, and choose **Put** from the menu that opens."
msgstr ""
"右键单击文件夹树中的文件夹图标或浏览器中的文件图标，然后从打开的菜单中选择**放置"
"**。"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:254
msgid "In the dialog that opens do any of the following:"
msgstr "在打开的对话框中，执行以下任一操作："

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:256
msgid ""
"If you are putting a folder, check which files and folders contained by the "
"selected folder have to be put in the central repository."
msgstr ""
"如果要放置文件夹，请检查所选文件夹包含的哪些文件和文件夹必须放置在中央存储库中。"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:258
msgid ""
"If you are putting a scene file (TNZ format) activate the **Put Scene "
"Contents** if you want to put the files used in the scene as well."
msgstr ""
"如果要放置场景文件（TNZ格式），如果要同时放置场景中使用的文件，请激活**放置场景"
"内容**。"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:260
msgid "Type a comment if required and click the **Put** button."
msgstr "如果需要，请键入注释，然后单击**放置**按钮。"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:266
msgid "Editing Files"
msgstr "编辑文件"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:267
msgid ""
"When using the version control system, in order to modify files you have to put "
"them in **Edit** mode *before loading them* into OpenToonz; if not, they will "
"be loaded as *read-only*."
msgstr ""
"使用版本控制系统时，为了修改文件，您必须在将文件加载到OpenToonz之前将其置于**编"
"辑**模式*；如果没有，它们将被加载为只读。"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:269
msgid "|edit|"
msgstr "|编辑|"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:271
msgid ""
"The **Edit** operation \"locks\" the file, so only the user running the command "
"will be able to modify it (preventing other users using the same *central "
"repository* from unlocking it and being able to modify it). At the moment a "
"file is about to be edited, it's possible to type in a *Comment*, to let the "
"other users know about your editing operation."
msgstr ""
"**编辑**操作“锁定”文件，因此只有运行该命令的用户才能修改它（防止使用同一*中央存"
"储库*的其他用户解锁并修改它）。当文件即将被编辑时，可以键入*注释*，让其他用户知"
"道您的编辑操作。"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:273
msgid "|edit_scene|"
msgstr "|edit_scene|"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:275
msgid ""
"When editing a scene file (TNZ format), in the dialog that opens it's possible "
"to check the **Edit Scene Contents** option, in order to be able to edit the "
"materials used in the scene as well. If you choose to edit only the scene file, "
"or if some material used in the scene is currently being edited by other users "
"sharing the same central repository, the locked frames of that levels will be "
"displayed with a forbidden icon in the Level Strip."
msgstr ""
"编辑场景文件（TNZ格式）时，在打开的对话框中，可以选中**编辑场景内容**选项，以便"
"能够编辑场景中使用的材质。如果您选择仅编辑场景文件，或者场景中使用的某些材质当前"
"正由共享同一中央存储库的其他用户编辑，则该级别的锁定帧将在级别栏中显示为禁用图"
"标。"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:277
msgid "|edit_frame_range|"
msgstr "|edit_frame_range|"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:279
msgid ""
"The **Edit Frame Range** command is available as well, to let a user edit only "
"the *needed frames* of any Toonz Vector or Toonz Raster animation level. This "
"way, different users can work at the same time *on different frame ranges* of "
"the same animation level."
msgstr ""
"**编辑帧范围**命令也可用，允许用户仅编辑任何Toonz矢量或Toonz光栅动画级别的*所需"
"帧*。这样，不同的用户可以同时*在同一动画级别的不同帧范围*上工作。"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:281
msgid "|unlock|"
msgstr "|unlock|"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:283
msgid ""
"When you want to release files from the *editing mode*, so that others can work "
"on them, you can use the **Unlock** command."
msgstr ""
"当您想从*编辑模式*中释放文件，以便其他人可以对其进行操作时，可以使用**解锁**命"
"令。"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:285
msgid ""
"Files are in read-only mode (or in locked mode) in case a user is *editing* "
"them, by setting the file system read-only attribute. For this reason, manually "
"using the OS (instead of the appropriate version control commands) to change "
"this status, may cause serious inconsistencies in the version control system."
msgstr ""
"通过设置文件系统只读属性，如果用户正在*编辑*文件，则文件处于只读模式（或锁定模"
"式）。因此，手动使用操作系统（而不是适当的版本控制命令）更改此状态可能会导致版本"
"控制系统中的严重不一致。"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:287
msgid "**To edit an updated file:**"
msgstr "**要编辑更新的文件，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:289
#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:297
msgid "Right-click the file and choose **Edit** from the menu that opens."
msgstr "右键单击文件，然后从打开的菜单中选择**编辑**。"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:291
#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:299
msgid ""
"In the dialog that opens if you are editing a scene file (TNZ format) activate "
"the **Edit Scene Contents** if you want to edit the files used in the scene as "
"well."
msgstr ""
"在编辑场景文件（TNZ格式）时打开的对话框中，如果要编辑场景中使用的文件，请激活**"
"编辑场景内容**。"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:293
#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:313
msgid "Type a comment if required and click the **Edit** button."
msgstr "如果需要，请键入注释，然后单击**编辑**按钮。"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:295
msgid ""
"**To edit a file that is older than the version available in the central "
"repository:**"
msgstr "**要编辑比中央存储库中可用版本旧的文件，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:301
msgid "Type a comment if required and do one of the following:"
msgstr "如果需要，请键入注释，然后执行以下操作之一："

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:303
msgid ""
"Click the **Get and Edit** button to get the latest version of the files and "
"edit them."
msgstr "单击**获取和编辑**按钮以获取文件的最新版本并对其进行编辑。"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:305
msgid ""
"Click the **Edit** button to edit the version of the files that is currently in "
"your local working copy."
msgstr "单击**编辑**按钮编辑当前本地工作副本中的文件版本。"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:307
msgid "**To edit only the needed frames of a Toonz level file:**"
msgstr "**要仅编辑Toanz级别文件所需的帧，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:309
msgid ""
"Right-click the file and choose **Edit Frame Range** from the menu that opens."
msgstr "右键单击该文件，然后从打开的菜单中选择**编辑帧范围**。"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:311
msgid "In the dialog that opens set the frame range you want to edit."
msgstr "在打开的对话框中设置要编辑的帧范围。"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:315
msgid "**To release a file from the editing mode:**"
msgstr "**要从编辑模式中释放文件，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:317
msgid "Right-click the file and choose **Unlock** from the menu that opens."
msgstr "右键单击文件，然后从打开的菜单中选择**解锁**。"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:319
msgid "**To check the editing state of a locked file:**"
msgstr "**要检查锁定文件的编辑状态，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:321
msgid "Right-click the file and choose **Edit Info** from the menu that opens."
msgstr "右键单击文件，然后从打开的菜单中选择**编辑信息**。"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:327
msgid "Retrieving File Revisions"
msgstr "检索文件修订"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:328
msgid ""
"One of the main advantages of using a version control system is that the "
"*history* of the revisions for every file in the production database is always "
"available. This means that it's possible to very easily retrieve previous "
"versions of any file."
msgstr ""
"使用版本控制系统的主要优点之一是，生产数据库中每个文件的修订历史始终可用。这意味"
"着可以非常容易地检索任何文件的先前版本。"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:330
msgid ""
"To retrieve older file versions it's possible to use the **Get Revision** "
"command. When used on a single file it displays a timeline with all the file "
"versions; in the timeline you can check the different file versions with the "
"related icons and information, and select which version to get in order to edit "
"it."
msgstr ""
"要检索旧文件版本，可以使用**获取修订**命令。当在单个文件上使用时，它会显示一个包"
"含所有文件版本的时间线；在时间线中，您可以使用相关图标和信息检查不同的文件版本，"
"并选择要获取的版本进行编辑。"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:332
msgid "|get_revision|"
msgstr "|get_revision|"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:334
msgid ""
"When getting a revision of a scene file (TNZ format), in the dialog that opens "
"it's possible to check the **Get Scene Contents** option in order to get the "
"revisions of the materials used in the scene as well."
msgstr ""
"获取场景文件（TNZ格式）的修订版时，可以在打开的对话框中选中**获取场景内容**选"
"项，以获取场景中使用的材质的修订版。"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:336
msgid "|get_revision_multiple_files|"
msgstr "|get_vision_multiple_files|"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:338
msgid ""
"When used on a multiple files selection it opens a dialog that allows you to "
"specify the time, day, week or date of the files version you want to retrieve."
msgstr ""
"当用于多个文件选择时，它会打开一个对话框，允许您指定要检索的文件版本的时间、日"
"期、星期或日期。"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:340
msgid "**To retrieve an older revision of a file:**"
msgstr "**要检索文件的旧版本，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:342
msgid "Right-click the file and choose **Get Revision** from the menu that opens."
msgstr "右键单击该文件，然后从打开的菜单中选择**获取修订**。"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:344
msgid ""
"In the dialog that opens look for the file version you are interested in and "
"select it; if you are editing a scene file (TNZ format) activate the **Edit "
"Scene Contents** if you want to get the revision of the files used in the scene "
"as well."
msgstr ""
"在打开的对话框中，查找您感兴趣的文件版本并选择它；如果要编辑场景文件（TNZ格"
"式），请激活**编辑场景内容**，以获取场景中使用的文件的修订版。"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:346
msgid "Do one of the following:"
msgstr "执行以下操作之一："

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:348
msgid ""
"Click the **Get Selected Revision** button to get the selected file version."
msgstr "单击**获取所选修订**按钮以获取所选文件版本。"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:350
msgid "Click the **Get Last Revision** button to get the latest file version."
msgstr "单击**获取上次修订**按钮以获取最新文件版本。"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:352
msgid "**To retrieve an older revision of a selection of multiple files:**"
msgstr "**要检索所选多个文件的旧版本，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:354
msgid ""
"Right-click any of the selected files and choose **Get Revision** from the menu "
"that opens."
msgstr "右键单击任何选定的文件，然后从打开的菜单中选择**获取修订**。"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:356
msgid ""
"In the dialog that opens specify how much older the version of the files you "
"want to retrieve has to be, by doing one of the following:"
msgstr "在打开的对话框中，通过执行以下操作之一，指定要检索的文件版本必须有多旧："

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:358
msgid "Specify a *time* in hours and minutes."
msgstr "指定以小时和分钟为单位的*时间*。"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:360
msgid "Specify a number of *days*."
msgstr "指定天数。"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:362
msgid "Specify a number of *weeks*."
msgstr "指定*周数*。"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:364
msgid "Specify and exact *date and time*."
msgstr "指定并精确*日期和时间*。"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:372
msgid "Understanding the Folder and File Icons"
msgstr "了解文件夹和文件图标"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:373
msgid ""
"According to the folder and file icons you can tell if the folder or the file "
"in the working copy is updated or not to the latest version available in the "
"central repository, and if files are edited by other users and locked."
msgstr ""
"根据文件夹和文件图标，您可以判断工作副本中的文件夹或文件是否已更新到中央存储库中"
"可用的最新版本，以及文件是否已被其他用户编辑并锁定。"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:375
msgid ""
"If the File Browser displays files as a List, the information about the version "
"control status is displayed in the column labeled *Version Control*."
msgstr ""
"如果文件浏览器将文件显示为列表，则有关版本控制状态的信息将显示在标记为*版本控制*"
"的列中。"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:377
msgid "For **folders** the following icons are used:"
msgstr "对于**文件夹**，使用以下图标："

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:379
msgid ""
"|grey_folder| A *grey* folder icon is used for folders available only in the "
"*repository*. You can use the **Get** command to copy them to the local "
"*working copy*."
msgstr ""
"|grey_folder|*grey*文件夹图标用于仅在*存储库*中可用的文件夹。您可以使用**获取**"
"命令将它们复制到本地*工作副本*。"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:381
msgid ""
"|colored_folder_with_yellow_mark| A colored folder icon with a *yellow mark* is "
"used when the folder contents in the *working copy* is not up to date and does "
"not match to the folder contents in the *repository*: this is the case when "
"there are modified or new files in the *working copy* or there are modified or "
"new files in the *repository*. You can use the **Get** command to copy them to "
"the local *working copy*."
msgstr ""
"|colored_folder_with_yellow_mark |当*工作副本*中的文件夹内容不是最新的，并且与*"
"存储库*中的内容不匹配时，使用带有*黄色标记*的彩色文件夹图标：当*工作拷贝*中有修"
"改过的或新的文件，或者*存储库中有修改后的或新文件时，就会出现这种情况。您可以使"
"用**获取**命令将它们复制到本地*工作副本*。"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:383
msgid ""
"|colored_folder_with_green_mark| A colored folder icon with a *green mark* is "
"used when the folder contents in the *working copy* is up to date and matches "
"to the folder contents in the *repository*."
msgstr ""
"|colored_folder_with_green_mark |当*工作副本*中的文件夹内容是最新的并且与*存储库"
"*中的内容匹配时，使用带有*绿色标记*的彩色文件夹图标。"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:385
msgid ""
"|colored_folder_with_plus_mark| A colored folder with a *plus mark* is used for "
"folders available only in the *working copy*. You can use the **Put** command "
"to copy them to the *central repository*."
msgstr ""
"|colored_folder_with_plus_mark |带有*加号*的彩色文件夹用于仅在*工作副本*中可用的"
"文件夹。您可以使用**Put**命令将它们复制到*中央存储库*。"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:388
msgid "For **files** the following icons are used:"
msgstr "对于**文件**，使用以下图标："

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:390
msgid ""
"A generic *grey* icon is used for files available only in the *repository*. You "
"can use the **Get** command to copy them to the local *working copy*."
msgstr ""
"通用*灰色*图标用于仅在*存储库*中可用的文件。您可以使用**获取**命令将它们复制到本"
"地*工作副本*。"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:392
msgid ""
"|grey_mark_check| The file icon with a *grey check mark* is used when files in "
"the *working copy* are up to date and match to the latest version available in "
"the *repository*. The files are in *read-only mode*, and they have to be in "
"*edit mode* in order to be modified."
msgstr ""
"|grey_mark_check |当*工作副本*中的文件是最新的并且与*存储库*中可用的最新版本匹配"
"时，使用带有*灰色复选标记*的文件图标。文件处于*只读模式*，必须处于*编辑模式*才能"
"进行修改。"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:394
msgid ""
"|green_mark_check| The file icon with a *green check mark* is used when files "
"in the *working copy* are in *edit mode*."
msgstr ""
"|green_mark_check |当*工作副本*中的文件处于*编辑模式*时，使用带有*绿色复选标记*"
"的文件图标。"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:396
msgid ""
"|half_grey_mark_check| The file icon with a *green check mark on a grey and "
"white background* is used when files in the *working copy* are partially in "
"*edit mode*."
msgstr ""
"|half_grey_mark_check |当*工作副本*中的文件部分处于*编辑模式*时，使用灰白色背景"
"上带有*绿色复选标记的文件图标。"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:398
msgid ""
"|red_exclamation_mark_check| The file icon with a *red exclamation mark* is "
"used when files in the *working copy* are newer than the latest version "
"available in the *repository*, because you modified them. You can use the "
"**Put** command to copy them to the *central repository*."
msgstr ""
"|half_grey_mark_check |当*工作副本*中的文件部分处于*编辑模式*时，使用灰白色背景"
"上带有*绿色复选标记的文件图标。"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:400
msgid ""
"|half_grey_red_exclamation_mark_check| The file icon with a *red exclamation "
"mark on a grey and white background* is used when files in the *working copy* "
"are partially newer than to the latest version available in the *repository*, "
"because you modified them. You can use the **Put** command to copy them to the "
"*central repository*."
msgstr ""
"|half_grey_red_exclamation_mark_check |当*工作副本*中的文件部分更新于*存储库*中"
"可用的最新版本时，使用灰色和白色背景上带有*红色感叹号的文件图标。您可以使用"
"**Put**命令将它们复制到*中央存储库*。"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:402
msgid ""
"|orange_exclamation_mark_check| The file icon with an *orange exclamation mark* "
"is used when files in the *working copy* are older than the latest version "
"available in the *repository*, because someone modified them. You can use the "
"**Get** command to copy them to the *local working copy*."
msgstr ""
"|orange_exclamation_mark_check |当*工作副本*中的文件比*存储库*中可用的最新版本旧"
"时，使用带有*橙色感叹号*的文件图标，因为有人修改了它们。您可以使用**获取**命令将"
"它们复制到*本地工作副本*。"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:404
msgid ""
"|lock_mark| The file icon with an *lock mark* is used when files are in *edit "
"mode* by other users. For these files it is only possible to check the "
"information about the user editing the file."
msgstr ""
"|lock_mark |当文件处于*编辑模式*时，其他用户会使用带有*锁标记*的文件图标。对于这"
"些文件，只能检查有关编辑文件的用户的信息。"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:406
msgid ""
"|half_grey_lock_mark| The file icon with a *lock mark on a grey and white "
"background* is used when files are *partially in edit mode* by other users."
msgstr ""
"|half_grey_lock_mark |当其他用户*部分处于编辑模式*时，使用灰色和白色背景上带有*"
"锁标记的文件图标。"

#: ../../source/using_the_version_control.rst:408
msgid ""
"|blue_plus_mark| The file icon with the *plus mark* is used for files available "
"only in the *working copy*. You can use the **Put** command to copy them to the "
"*central repository*."
msgstr ""
"|blue_plus_mark |带有*加号*的文件图标用于仅在*工作副本*中可用的文件。您可以使用"
"**Put**命令将它们复制到*中央存储库*。"
